<title>POLAND: Polish Stomil Sanok to start bourse trade Jan 16.</title>
<headline>Polish Stomil Sanok to start bourse trade Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish rubber company Stomil Sanok SA will enter the main market of the Warsaw bourse on January 16, PAP quoted the bourse's president as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;On Thursday, January 16, Stomil Sanok will debut on the bourse, 5.2 million shares will enter the floor,&quot; PAP quoted Wieslaw Rozlucki as saying.</p>
<p>Stomil Sanok's November 500,000-share initial public offerring, priced at 25 zlotys per share was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
